  "title": "Hollow",
  "subtitle": "A mercenary. A rogue leader named Kurtz. A descent into the darkness of space and the human soul.",
  "description": "Hollow is a sci-fi horror audio drama from Violet Hour Media — starring Doug Bradley (Pinhead, Hellraiser franchise) as Kurtz and Shiva Negar (American Assassin, Seal Team) as Amelia — a futuristic retelling of Joseph Conrad's Heart of Darkness set across the colonies and outer worlds of a corporate-controlled galaxy. Major Amelia Wallenrod is a battle-hardened mercenary hired to track down a rogue leader named Kurtz. What begins as a corporate mission becomes a descent into the darkness of space, colonialism, and the human soul. Thirteen episodes across two seasons. All available now. Directed and produced by Maria Corso. Written by Peter Lancucki and Michael Ryan Assip. Executive produced by Cassie Jozefov. Original score by acclaimed horror composer Umberto. A Violet Hour Media production. LISTENER WARNING: This program includes depictions of violence and other subject matter that may be upsetting for some listeners. Popular Topics Include: sci-fi horror podcast, science fiction audio drama, horror fiction podcast, Heart of Darkness retelling, space horror podcast, colonialism horror, audio drama, Doug Bradley, Doug Bradley podcast, Hellraiser cast podcast, Pinhead actor podcast, Doug Bradley audio drama, Hellraiser, Pinhead, Shiva Negar, Umberto composer, Violet Hour Media, fiction podcast, best horror podcast, narrative podcast, Joseph Conrad, corporate dystopia, space opera horror, alien worlds, futuristic horror, sci-fi horror complete series, all episodes available.",
